Mungkin kalian sudah tidak asing lagi dengan text editor satu ini, yup VIM atau Vi Improved. Vim adalah text editor berbasis terminal yang sangat mudah digunakan dan mempercepat pekerjaan, vim selalu diibaratkan text editor yang susah karena penggunanya belum terbiasa akan bind-key defaultnya.

h = left
j = down
k = up
l = right

$ = end char of line
0 = first char of line


i = Insert Mode
:wq = Write and Quit
:q! = Quit without saving any change
:w = write
:e = edit file
:colorscheme = change colorscheme
/<any text> = find <any text>


ESC = Idle mode
a = append text
o = insert below line
O = insert above line

v = visual mode
C-a = Visual mode block
gg = go to first line
G = go to latest line
C-g = file information
:<any number> = go to line <any number>
C-u = up one page
C-d = down one page
u = undo
C-r = redo
dd = delete line
yy = copy / yank line
p = paste





Multi-lines comment
masuk visual mode block, pilih line yang akan di comment, S-i, comment char #, ESC, ESC.

Save as root
:w !sudo tee % = save file with root permission
